### Test Student HTTP Service - Course Registration Service

### Get student by ID from User Management Service
GET https://localhost:7293/api/student/1
Accept: application/json

### Check if student exists
GET https://localhost:7293/api/student/1/exists
Accept: application/json

### Get multiple students by IDs
POST https://localhost:7293/api/student/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3]

### Register student for course using existing student ID
POST https://localhost:7293/api/student/1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": 1,
  "subjectIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### Test User Management Service directly (for comparison)
GET https://localhost:7033/user/students/1
Accept: application/json
